    "gen_ai.input.messages": "[{\"role\":\"user\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"<session_context>\\nThis is the Gemini CLI. We are setting up the context for our chat.\\nToday's date is Sunday, November 1, 2026 (formatted according to the user's locale).\\nMy operating system is: linux\\nThe project's temporary directory is: /home/simra/.gemini/tmp/run\\n- **Workspace Directories:**\\n  - /home/simra/cse115a/lab/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/work/run\\n- **Directory Structure:**\\n\\nShowing up to 200 items (files + folders).\\n\\n/home/simra/cse115a/lab/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/work/run/\\n├───.gitignore\\n├───GEMINI.md\\n├───README.md\\n├───requirements.txt\\n├───TASK.md\\n├───.gemini/\\n│   └───settings.json\\n├───shopcart/\\n│   ├───__init__.py\\n│   ├───cart.py\\n│   ├───catalog.py\\n│   └───pricing.py\\n└───tests/\\n    ├───__init__.py\\n    ├───test_cart.py\\n    └───test_pricing.py\\n\\n\\n<loaded_context>\\n<project_context>\\n--- Context from: /home/simra/cse115a/lab/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/work/run/GEMINI.md ---\\n# Project context\\n\\n- Python 3.10+ library; no third-party runtime dependencies.\\n- All money is integer **cents**. Never use floats for stored amounts.\\n- Run tests with `python -m pytest -q` from the repository root.\\n- Keep functions small; pricing rules live in `shopcart/pricing.py`, cart state in `shopcart/cart.py`.\\n--- End of Context from: /home/simra/cse115a/lab/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/work/run/GEMINI.md ---\\n</project_context>\\n</loaded_context>\\n</session_context>\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"Here is the user's editor context as a JSON object. This is for your information only.\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"activeFile\\\": {\\n    \\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/simra/cse115a/lab/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/work/writeup.md\\\",\\n    \\\"cursor\\\": {\\n      \\\"line\\\": 4,\\n      \\\"character\\\": 52\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"otherOpenFiles\\\": [\\n    \\\"/home/simra/cse115a/lab/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/writeup.md\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\\n```\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"Read TASK.md and complete all of it. First write out your plan, then carry it out without waiting for my confirmation.\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"name\":\"update_topic\",\"id\":\"call_818123\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"strategic_intent\\\":\\\"Read TASK.md to understand the assignment requirements and formulate a comprehensive execution plan.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Reading Task & Planning\\\"}\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"id\":\"call_818126\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"file_path\\\":\\\"TASK.md\\\"}\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"tool_call_response\",\"response\":\"{\\\"output\\\":\\\"Current topic: \\\\\\\"Reading Task & Planning\\\\\\\"\\\\nTopic summary: ...\\\\n\\\\nStrategic Intent: Read TASK.md to understand the assignment requirements and formulate a comprehensive execution plan.\\\"}\",\"id\":\"call_818123\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call_response\",\"response\":\"{\\\"output\\\":\\\"# Task\\\\n\\\\n## 1. Fix the failing tests\\\\n`python -m pytest` currently fails. Make the whole suite pass by fixing the code in\\\\n`shopcart/`. The existing tests describe the intended behavior — do not edit them for\\\\nthis step.\\\\n\\\\n## 2. Add shipping to cart totals\\\\n- Orders pay a flat **$5.99** shipping fee (`599` cents).\\\\n- Shipping is **free** when the subtotal *after discount, before tax* is **$50.00 or more**.\\\\n- An empty cart pays no shipping.\\\\n- Shipping is **not taxed**: `total = tax(discounted subtotal) + shipping`.\\\\n- Put