    "gen_ai.input.messages": "[{\"role\":\"user\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"<session_context>\\nThis is the Gemini CLI. We are setting up the context for our chat.\\nToday's date is Sunday, November 1, 2026 (formatted according to the user's locale).\\nMy operating system is: linux\\nThe project's temporary directory is: /home/simra/.gemini/tmp/run\\n- **Workspace Directories:**\\n  - /home/simra/cse115a/lab/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/work/run\\n- **Directory Structure:**\\n\\nShowing up to 200 items (files + folders).\\n\\n/home/simra/cse115a/lab/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/work/run/\\n├───.gitignore\\n├───GEMINI.md\\n├───README.md\\n├───requirements.txt\\n├───TASK.md\\n├───.gemini/\\n│   └───settings.json\\n├───shopcart/\\n│   ├───__init__.py\\n│   ├───cart.py\\n│   ├───catalog.py\\n│   └───pricing.py\\n└───tests/\\n    ├───__init__.py\\n    ├───test_cart.py\\n    └───test_pricing.py\\n\\n\\n<loaded_context>\\n<project_context>\\n--- Context from: /home/simra/cse115a/lab/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/work/run/GEMINI.md ---\\n# Project context\\n\\n- Python 3.10+ library; no third-party runtime dependencies.\\n- All money is integer **cents**. Never use floats for stored amounts.\\n- Run tests with `python -m pytest -q` from the repository root.\\n- Keep functions small; pricing rules live in `shopcart/pricing.py`, cart state in `shopcart/cart.py`.\\n--- End of Context from: /home/simra/cse115a/lab/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/work/run/GEMINI.md ---\\n</project_context>\\n</loaded_context>\\n</session_context>\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"Here is the user's editor context as a JSON object. This is for your information only.\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"activeFile\\\": {\\n    \\\"pa